{"4680720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STARSHIP BLOOPERS", "steam_appid": 4680720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>WORK TOGETHER (GOOD LUCK WITH THAT)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/4f3fa0f26f20aeb4e2ae10d3d9c2e879.poster.avif?t=1785888581\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/4f3fa0f26f20aeb4e2ae10d3d9c2e879.webm?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/4f3fa0f26f20aeb4e2ae10d3d9c2e879.mp4?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>All Hands on Deck? You'll need to rely on your crewmates if you want any hope of making it through space alive, not that they'll be much help. Repair damaged systems, respond to emergencies and work together to stop small problems from becoming full ship-wide disasters.</p></p><br><h1>EXPLORE SPACE (WHAT COULD POSSIBLY GO WRONG?)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your course through space, explore dangerous locations and alien hazards you probably weren't ready for. Gather the resources you need to keep your ship running and escape the solar system before time runs out and the sun goes supernova.</p></p><br><h1>SURVIVE (SKILL ISSUE)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/31145cd23c557f019437cd242d28b765.poster.avif?t=1785888581\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/31145cd23c557f019437cd242d28b765.webm?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/31145cd23c557f019437cd242d28b765.mp4?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Space doesn’t care about you! Aliens, fires, broken systems, and disasters you definitely didn't plan for can strike at any moment. Think fast, adapt to the chaos and try to hold it together long enough to finish the mission.</p></p><br><h1>KEEP YOUR SHIP TOGETHER! (OR DON'T, SEE WHAT HAPPENS)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is your only lifeline. Without it you're just floating in space, which is not ideal. Keep it repaired, keep your crew alive and hold everything together long enough to make it out in one piece.</p></p><br><h1>EVERY RUN IS DIFFERENT (FRESH CHAOS EVERY TIME)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/5d735df0f25fcec763ea89e23b39695d.poster.avif?t=1785888581\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/5d735df0f25fcec763ea89e23b39695d.webm?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/5d735df0f25fcec763ea89e23b39695d.mp4?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Sector-based runs mean every jump brings new risks, resources and decisions. No two missions play out the same way, so whatever worked last time probably won't save you now.</p></p><br><h1>RANK UP (GATEKEPT BY YOUR OWN INCOMPETENCE)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on crew roles, earn upgrades, unlock new abilities and climb the ranks. Survive long enough and you might even look like you know what you're doing.</p></p><br><h1>KEY FEATURES (NO CAP)</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–6 player online co-op</strong> aboard a failing starship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space survival action</strong> with repairs, combat, crafting, scavenging and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic ship emergencies</strong> including fires, hull breaches, oxygen loss, rogue AI and system failures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien threats and infestations</strong> that force the crew to respond fast or lose control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sector-based runs</strong> where each jump brings new risks, resources and decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew roles and progression</strong> with upgrades, rank, unlocks and status rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability</strong> driven by unpredictable disasters and crew-driven chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROWDPLAY features planned</strong> for streamer and spectator interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big dumb fun</strong> with enough pressure to matter and enough stupidity to make failure worth it!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>DESIGNED FOR STREAMS, CLIPS AND CROWDPLAY (WATCH THIS SPACE)</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some games are fun to play. Some are fun to watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STARSHIP BLOOPERS </strong>is being built for both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Crowdplay features planned from the start, spectators will be able to influence the chaos and help turn every mission into a live, interactive disaster show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your viewers might save you. Your viewers might doom you. Either way, they’ll be part of the story.<br><br>More coming soon...</p></p><br><h1>WORK IN PROGRESS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that STARSHIP BLOOPERS is currently in early pre-production. All assets/visuals are work-in-progress and subject to change.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/2346cbfae6db7e53adb42611223593f6.poster.avif?t=1785888581\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/2346cbfae6db7e53adb42611223593f6.webm?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/2346cbfae6db7e53adb42611223593f6.mp4?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>STARSHIP BLOOPERS</strong> is a chaotic co-op space survival game where one wrong move can doom the mission. Play with 2 to 6 crewmates as you traverse space, gather resources, survive disasters, battle aliens and each other's incompetence before the sun goes supernova. Can you keep your SHIP together?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/2346cbfae6db7e53adb42611223593f6.poster.avif?t=1785888581\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/2346cbfae6db7e53adb42611223593f6.webm?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680720/extras/2346cbfae6db7e53adb42611223593f6.mp4?t=1785888581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>STARSHIP BLOOPERS</strong> is a chaotic co-op space survival game where one wrong move can doom the mission. Play with 2 to 6 crewmates as you traverse space, gather resources, survive disasters, battle aliens and each other's incompetence before the sun goes supernova. Can you keep your SHIP together?</p>", "short_description": "STARSHIP BLOOPERS is a chaotic co-op space survival game where one wrong move can doom 